WEBVTT

00:06.610 --> 00:07.980
Destla.

00:09.020 --> 00:11.180
For Demon Lord.

00:18.440 --> 00:19.570
Go to hell!

00:27.170 --> 00:29.420
It's boring!

00:30.050 --> 00:31.010
Bye bye.

00:36.460 --> 00:40.500
Don't touch my Seiichi.

00:50.320 --> 00:51.600
Amazing!

01:13.590 --> 01:16.340
Seiichi!

01:23.340 --> 01:24.390
Saria!

01:24.390 --> 01:27.510
Let me help you now.

01:33.730 --> 01:38.810
Saria is so ugly when turning into a gorilla.

01:43.730 --> 01:44.650
Bye bye.

01:57.460 --> 02:02.260
Saria!

02:21.280 --> 02:23.370
Seiichi!

02:35.500 --> 02:38.500
(The Fruit of Evolution 2:
Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made)

04:01.250 --> 04:03.050
(The Fruit of Evolution)

04:03.050 --> 04:03.750
Saria!

04:07.250 --> 04:08.560
Don't cry.

04:09.590 --> 04:10.560
Seiichi!

04:12.060 --> 04:15.270
I don't regret it.

04:16.360 --> 04:19.360
I've been very happy.

04:21.180 --> 04:22.310
I can

04:22.940 --> 04:26.060
become your partner.

04:27.240 --> 04:27.740
I'm very

04:29.020 --> 04:33.450
very happy.

04:45.370 --> 04:46.300
Saria!

04:48.750 --> 04:51.720
Saria is dead. It's all your fault.

04:52.100 --> 04:54.260
Because you are not powerful enough.

04:56.230 --> 04:58.930
I've got you into despair.

04:59.640 --> 05:01.810
Now wake up!

05:05.310 --> 05:06.360
Now!

05:06.740 --> 05:09.270
It's your turn to get me something.

05:19.700 --> 05:20.540
Here it comes!

05:33.720 --> 05:36.060
It's about time, Seiichi.

05:42.860 --> 05:45.490
Yes, that's it. Go on!

05:46.690 --> 05:48.110
Sacrifice yourself

05:48.310 --> 05:49.990
to revive Demon Lord.

06:12.300 --> 06:13.600
At last!

06:14.510 --> 06:16.130
Time for revival!

06:24.180 --> 06:25.310
Anyway.

06:27.240 --> 06:30.740
No matter.

06:41.500 --> 06:46.000
As it is, you will also become Demon Lord.

06:50.720 --> 06:52.500
If all this

06:53.500 --> 06:56.310
could end!

07:19.250 --> 07:20.370
This place is...

07:23.170 --> 07:24.170
Yeah.

07:25.170 --> 07:28.050
It's my adventurous life.

07:29.500 --> 07:31.430
My victorious life!

07:34.080 --> 07:36.850
All the highlights.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.980
Does that mean

07:41.480 --> 07:45.560
I'm about to disappear from this world?

07:48.860 --> 07:50.140
But

07:51.310 --> 07:52.910
now I see

07:54.490 --> 07:56.240
after arriving here

07:57.660 --> 07:59.570
I have always been successful.

08:01.540 --> 08:04.950
It's really amazing!

08:07.330 --> 08:08.080
But

08:10.700 --> 08:12.330
after that dream

08:14.580 --> 08:16.380
things are getting strange.

08:16.630 --> 08:18.880
That's not the case, Seiichi.

08:19.880 --> 08:21.560
What do you mean?

08:22.680 --> 08:24.010
Think about it.

08:31.810 --> 08:33.140
It's what I used to be.

08:33.140 --> 08:35.770
(Fatty! You stinky bastard!)
It's what I used to be.

08:39.020 --> 08:41.870
This is your real self.

08:42.280 --> 08:44.750
All that happen in this world are illusions.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.160
They're not real.

08:48.120 --> 08:49.620
Are you seeing someone?

08:52.870 --> 08:53.840
Teacher!

08:59.380 --> 09:00.670
Teacher!

09:01.720 --> 09:02.800
Teacher!

09:03.230 --> 09:04.600
Teacher!

09:09.610 --> 09:11.070
Not real?

09:11.520 --> 09:13.640
Obviously you haven't made any mistake.

09:14.020 --> 09:15.740
But you've been suffering a lot.

09:16.240 --> 09:17.520
Me too.

09:17.950 --> 09:20.650
One day, I lost everything suddenly.

09:24.250 --> 09:25.500
I think

09:25.500 --> 09:28.500
you've got the same idea.

09:28.500 --> 09:29.710
Of what?

09:29.710 --> 09:33.750
Of destroying this torturing world.

09:34.120 --> 09:36.840
Destroying the world.

09:37.370 --> 09:39.170
I will destroy the world.

09:39.880 --> 09:42.470
Do you want to join me?

09:43.260 --> 09:45.130
Because you and I

09:45.600 --> 09:47.130
are the same.

09:47.760 --> 09:48.730
Same?

09:49.010 --> 09:50.730
Yeah. We are the same.

09:54.110 --> 09:56.110
Seiichi!

09:56.770 --> 09:57.770
What?

09:59.150 --> 10:02.200
Our love for each other will evolve.

10:05.530 --> 10:06.250
No.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.150
What?

10:07.780 --> 10:10.080
We are different.

10:10.710 --> 10:12.500
Our ideas are different.

10:13.120 --> 10:14.290
What do you mean?

10:14.840 --> 10:16.290
It's strange.

10:16.840 --> 10:19.470
Because I was bullied.

10:19.750 --> 10:21.000
I've felt the pain.

10:21.290 --> 10:23.220
So I'm trying to be kind to people.

10:23.920 --> 10:24.970
What?

10:25.720 --> 10:27.010
What's this?

10:27.230 --> 10:29.010
Thank you, Seiichi.

10:29.260 --> 10:31.140
Thank you, Seiichi.

10:34.190 --> 10:36.110
If I hadn't felt the pain myself,

10:37.140 --> 10:40.450
I would not relate to other people's pain.

10:41.270 --> 10:43.020
Thank you, Seiichi.

10:43.270 --> 10:45.740
Thank you, master.

10:45.950 --> 10:47.900
Thank you, brother.

10:48.400 --> 10:49.250
Stop!

10:49.530 --> 10:51.160
Because I have felt the pain,

10:51.830 --> 10:56.040
- I'm trying to care about the people I meet.
- Thank you!

10:56.290 --> 10:57.000
Thank you!

10:57.370 --> 10:58.540
Thank you!

10:58.790 --> 10:59.620
Thank you!

10:59.970 --> 11:00.720
Thank you!

11:01.120 --> 11:02.000
Thank you!

11:02.500 --> 11:03.420
Thank you!

11:03.720 --> 11:04.500
Thank you!

11:05.050 --> 11:06.000
Thank you!

11:06.300 --> 11:07.220
Thank you!

11:07.510 --> 11:08.510
Thank you!

11:08.730 --> 11:09.480
Thank you!

11:09.600 --> 11:11.230
Thank you, Seiichi!

11:11.850 --> 11:12.640
Stop!

11:12.640 --> 11:15.320
Stop! Stop!

11:20.110 --> 11:21.990
How about this? Nothing for you to talk.

11:22.860 --> 11:24.450
Because I have felt the pain,

11:24.990 --> 11:25.580
I...

11:27.280 --> 11:29.250
Thank you, Seiichi!

11:30.150 --> 11:31.580
Although I'm a gorilla,

11:32.080 --> 11:33.580
you treat me as your partner.

11:36.590 --> 11:38.460
Saria, I...

11:40.000 --> 11:42.840
You're clever, not because of your Status,

11:43.290 --> 11:46.550
but because you're so kind.

11:46.920 --> 11:47.750
Saria.

11:48.220 --> 11:50.050
So, don't lose to him.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.190
Thank you.

11:52.980 --> 11:55.610
I've got things to do.

11:57.640 --> 11:59.890
Yeah. Come on!

11:59.890 --> 12:00.820
Seiichi!

12:03.020 --> 12:03.860
Just leave it to me!

12:09.490 --> 12:10.030
What?

12:23.790 --> 12:24.750
Let me teach you

12:26.920 --> 12:27.670
what is love.

12:28.850 --> 12:29.640
(The Fruit of Evolution 2:
Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made)

12:29.640 --> 12:31.130
The awakened love

12:31.510 --> 12:33.850
will have "Real Evolution".

12:35.690 --> 12:38.320
What the hell will happen?

13:24.610 --> 13:25.640
This song is...

13:36.660 --> 13:37.830
The evolution of love.

13:45.000 --> 13:46.340
Muscle.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.730
"Real Evolution" completed.

14:03.570 --> 14:04.440
Sorry to keep you waiting.

14:10.020 --> 14:11.580
You are...

14:12.080 --> 14:14.120
I am Real Seiichi.

14:14.830 --> 14:17.580
Status is all Love now.

14:17.960 --> 14:18.580
(Love)
Love

14:18.960 --> 14:22.160
What's wrong with you?

14:29.370 --> 14:30.220
What?

14:37.050 --> 14:37.670
Come on!

14:38.300 --> 14:39.130
Destla.

14:48.570 --> 14:49.990
This is our final battle.

14:54.150 --> 14:54.900
Destla!

14:55.490 --> 14:58.370
Try cutting my head with your scythe!

14:59.150 --> 15:00.530
What are you saying?

15:01.370 --> 15:02.750
"Absolute Death" is enough.

15:07.910 --> 15:08.590
Love

15:15.800 --> 15:16.970
Why?

15:19.010 --> 15:19.760
Love

15:25.010 --> 15:25.690
Love

15:25.980 --> 15:26.510
Love

15:26.890 --> 15:28.020
Love wins.

15:31.270 --> 15:32.270
Why?

15:32.270 --> 15:33.490
Doesn't work. Why?

15:33.490 --> 15:35.950
"Absolute Death" absorbed. Ultimate acquired:

15:35.950 --> 15:40.280
"Say 'I love you' in a loveless time 2023"

15:40.280 --> 15:41.660
Are you joking?

15:41.960 --> 15:44.210
Go to hell, Seiichi!

15:50.470 --> 15:53.090
We should be the same.

15:53.590 --> 15:56.470
We have both fallen into despair.

15:56.720 --> 15:57.920
But how could it be like this?

15:58.350 --> 16:01.690
Why can't you understand me?

16:01.980 --> 16:03.480
Why?

16:03.480 --> 16:05.940
I'm alone again.

16:06.550 --> 16:10.110
I'm thinking maybe we can understand each other.

16:11.440 --> 16:14.110
What's wrong with you?

16:14.360 --> 16:15.650
Why are you so kind?

16:16.240 --> 16:16.990
Why?

16:17.490 --> 16:20.030
Why are we so different?

16:21.500 --> 16:24.530
Actually I, I am also...

16:25.030 --> 16:25.830
It's okay.

16:26.710 --> 16:27.910
You can make a change.

16:32.500 --> 16:35.220
You can also become a kind person.

16:36.040 --> 16:38.470
After all, we are

16:39.630 --> 16:40.550
the same, aren't we?

16:43.100 --> 16:44.260
Really?

16:45.550 --> 16:46.980
Even I can do it?

16:49.860 --> 16:50.440
Yes.

16:51.320 --> 16:52.240
Of course you can.

16:53.240 --> 16:53.950
Thanks.

16:54.990 --> 16:57.120
I'm glad you can understand.

16:59.080 --> 17:01.580
Thank you, Seiichi.

17:10.710 --> 17:11.540
Why?

17:12.460 --> 17:13.720
Hey, come on!

17:14.290 --> 17:16.180
Skill: "Real-Getting better"

17:21.250 --> 17:23.390
No, it doesn't work.

17:24.640 --> 17:27.300
Thank you, Seiichi.

17:27.690 --> 17:28.400
Come on!

17:40.320 --> 17:41.610
Destla.

17:42.700 --> 17:45.360
I'm coming.

17:45.960 --> 17:46.960
Teacher.

17:48.420 --> 17:49.280
Destla.

17:50.250 --> 17:51.280
Destla!

18:12.730 --> 18:13.560
Destla!

18:20.610 --> 18:22.610
Good job, Seiichi!

18:28.410 --> 18:29.420
Saria!

18:29.860 --> 18:30.630
I'm back!

18:35.380 --> 18:36.250
Thank you.

18:36.790 --> 18:40.720
You are indeed the best one.

18:41.330 --> 18:42.390
Saria!

18:51.010 --> 18:52.550
I love you!

19:01.490 --> 19:04.020
Let's get back to them all.

19:04.360 --> 19:04.860
Okay.

19:06.780 --> 19:09.460
Hey, stop!

19:09.460 --> 19:11.460
I'm embarrassed.

19:11.920 --> 19:13.460
You are exhausted.

19:13.830 --> 19:15.170
You can rest for a while.

19:15.500 --> 19:15.920
Okay.

19:16.330 --> 19:18.580
Saria, you're very nice like this.

19:19.630 --> 19:20.500
Thank you.

19:30.980 --> 19:32.340
Everybody, we're back.

19:32.650 --> 19:33.730
We're back!

19:34.010 --> 19:35.900
Seiichi! Saria!

19:36.310 --> 19:37.900
It's great you are all right.

19:37.900 --> 19:39.770
Great! Great!

19:42.910 --> 19:44.560
You're worried about us.

19:45.060 --> 19:47.320
We've got a lot of trouble, but we are happy.

19:51.500 --> 19:54.280
Master, I'm really worried about you.

19:54.630 --> 19:56.710
Don't leave us behind again.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.960
From now on we have to be together.

19:59.330 --> 20:00.330
Okay?

20:00.880 --> 20:02.750
Okay. I agree.

20:03.220 --> 20:04.000
Seiichi.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.500
Barnabas.

20:06.970 --> 20:08.140
Where is Destla?

20:13.940 --> 20:14.940
I'm sorry.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.510
Well.

20:17.900 --> 20:19.730
You don't need to say sorry.

20:36.710 --> 20:39.210
I will stay here forever.

20:45.040 --> 20:46.330
It looks good.

20:46.330 --> 20:47.250
It looks delicious.

20:47.750 --> 20:48.930
Here, Seiichi!

20:48.930 --> 20:49.840
Open your mouth.

20:50.000 --> 20:51.260
That was clever, Saria!

20:51.550 --> 20:53.590
I'm gonna do this too.
Here, Seiichi! Open your mouth.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.510
Hey you!

20:57.230 --> 20:58.760
You stupid!

20:59.350 --> 21:01.730
This is for Seiichi!

21:02.400 --> 21:05.020
I will stay with these happy friends forever.

23:00.800 --> 23:01.840
Seiichi.

23:04.480 --> 23:07.810
The evolution of our love
will never stop, right?

23:08.440 --> 23:10.150
Never stop.

23:11.850 --> 23:12.520
Absolutely.

23:19.500 --> 23:21.820
We'll be together forever.

23:22.320 --> 23:23.820
In a world worth all our love.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.500
I love you!

23:29.170 --> 23:32.220
(The End)
